      "responsibilities": [
        "Area: lists the available seats of the area",
        "Observer: contract notified when a reservation changes",
        "Reservation: holds the seat, time slot, student and state of a booking",
        "Reservation: delegates cancel and check-in to its current state",
        "ReservationRegistry: saves and queries reservations",
        "Seat: tells whether it is free for a date and time slot",
        "Student: checks for an existing active or confirmed reservation in the slot",
        "StudyRoomRegistry: finds rooms, areas, seats and time slots",
        "Subject: keeps the observers of a reservation",
        "ActiveState: ACTIVE state: check-in confirms, cancel cancels",
        "ReservationState: state contract for cancel, check-in and end"
